01:06:51.450 --> 01:06:54.300
these early kind of Latin texts

01:06:54.300 --> 01:06:55.680
that are arising around the time

01:06:55.680 --> 01:06:57.900
that you're theorizing
written law to be coming in?

01:06:57.900 --> 01:07:00.240
Like Ennius' "Annales,"
like Naevius' "Punica,"

01:07:00.240 --> 01:07:02.700
like those sorts of, Cato's "Origines,"

01:07:02.700 --> 01:07:05.610
are you seeing the development
